    <ui:Comment DisplayName="Comment" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="502,557" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_1" Text="Full APPLY run. Gets the Prepayment Garments report (submits the request and downloads it, or uses Report_File), keeps LC OPENING CHAR rows with an unapplied amount, then: GRN by LC number + company (4c), then invoice entry, GRN match and prepayment apply (6_Create_Invoice). Bank_Filter (optional) keeps only rows whose report Supplier Name (column F) equals it exactly (ignoring case). PHASE 1 searches the GRN for rows of every unit (one responsibility switch per unit); GRN_Limit = how many rows to search (0 = all). PHASE 2 then creates invoices only for rows where a GRN was found; Max_Entries = how many invoices to COMPLETE (0 = all). Max_Errors stops the run after that many failures (0 = never stop). Each row result is appended to Log_File (default Apply_File\Apply_Main_Log.csv); rows already Completed there are skipped on later runs. Oracle must be open and logged in. Invoice_Date: the test server GL period is open only for FEB 2026; use today (dd-MMM-yyyy) on a server whose current period is open." />
